  "description": "Implement lease renewal (extend TTL or update heartbeat), release (explicit), and force-evict (admin) operations. All operations append to log and update index under lock. Verify ownership for renew/release.\n\n## Renewal Behavior\n- Finite leases (ttl_secs > 0): extend `expires_at` by TTL\n- Indefinite leases (ttl_secs = 0): update `last_beat` timestamp via heartbeat operation\n\nSee design doc section \"Lease Operations\".",
